    "AuraScene__ModelPlacement" : {
        "OffsetM"     : [-14.131, 0.0, 13.015],
        "RotationDeg" : 0.0,
        "FrontFacing" : "+Z",
        "CentredOn"   : "Focal",
        "Note"        : "One transform for every model file, applied before the engine builds the scene: turn about +Y by RotationDeg, then move by OffsetM (metres). The whitecard GLBs are already metres with +Y up (TrueVision3D GLB Builder), and SketchUp's Front (-green) is +Z, the engine's front, so a whitecard needs no turn. The import centres the Focal model files' footprint on the origin (the engine's camera presets look there) and leaves the ground level alone. Set once: changing it later moves the building under every saved view."
    },
